  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "To gather supplementary immortal materials for refining fortune rivalling heaven Immortal Gu, Old Ancestor Xue Hu goes to Zombie Alliance’s graveyard to steal immortal zombie corpses in place of the materials.",
      "chapters": [
        936
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "stolen-as-materials",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "char_old_ancestor_xue_hu",
        "fac_zombie_alliance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When immortal zombies die, their aperture completely dissipates and the dao marks in the aperture stay in the immortal zombie body. Immortal zombie bodies are therefore rich with dao marks and are special kinds of immortal materials, which is why Xue Hu steals from the immortal zombie graveyard. In the life-and-death immortal aperture revival method, other strength path immortal zombies’ corpses can be used as immortal materials and refined in a Gu formation to raise the grade of the life-and-death immortal aperture created.",
      "chapters": [
        939
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dao-marks-after-death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_formation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan demands that Blazing Heaven Demoness do her utmost to obtain as many strength path immortal zombie corpses as possible.",
      "chapters": [
        946
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "strength-path-demand",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_blazing_heaven_demoness"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Those strength path immortal zombie corpses later come from her, kept as a failsafe for that revival method.",
      "chapters": [
        1073
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "strength-path-demand",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In Earth Trench, Old Ancestor Xue Hu is again found stealing immortal zombie corpses.",
      "chapters": [
        990
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ongoing-theft",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_earth_earth_trench"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Even with Ma Hong Yun as a main ingredient, he still goes personally to Zombie Alliance to steal immortal zombie corpses while gathering immortal materials.",
      "chapters": [
        1131
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
